{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03916","headline":"奉和立春游苑迎春应制 · 阎朝隐","name":"奉和立春游苑迎春应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"管龠周移寰极里，乘舆望幸斗城闉。\n草根未结青丝缕，萝茑犹垂绿帔巾。\n鹊入巢中言改岁，燕衔书上道宜新。\n愿得长绳系取日，光临天子万年春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎朝隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03916.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03916","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}